@host = http://localhost:5102
@productId = COLE_AQUI_ID
### Cadastro de item (preço em centavos)
POST {{host}}/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{"sku":"CABO-10MM","name":"Cabo de cobre 10 mm²","minimumStock":5,"unitPriceCents":2500}
### Listar itens
GET {{host}}/api/products
### Entrada
POST {{host}}/api/products/{{productId}}/movements
Content-Type: application/json

{"type":"Entry","quantity":20,"reason":"Recebimento de material"}
### Saída
POST {{host}}/api/products/{{productId}}/movements
Content-Type: application/json

{"type":"Exit","quantity":3,"reason":"Atendimento de equipe"}
### Alertas
GET {{host}}/api/products/low-stock
### Histórico
GET {{host}}/api/products/{{productId}}/movements
